# Build context is workers/ (Railway root directory /workers), so the repo-root
# .env, venv/, reference/, .cache/, apps/ and .git/ are outside the context
# already. They are listed anyway so this file stays safe if the context ever
# widens: no secret and no local junk may enter the image.
.env
.env*
venv/
reference/
.cache/
node_modules/
apps/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
